description:
Design an 8-bit wide XOR gate that computes the bitwise exclusive OR of two 8-bit inputs, A and B, and outputs the result as an 8-bit signal Z. The output Z is updated whenever there is a change in either input, reflecting the corresponding bitwise XOR of A and B.
module top_module(
  input [7:0] A,
  input [7:0] B,
